        "description": "An internationally recognized lifestyle publication that explores the intersection of community, arts, and design through an intentional lens. Since its inception in 2011, it has established a reputation for its distinct minimalist aesthetic and deep-dive editorial features on culture, home, and creativity. The magazine appeals to a global, design-conscious audience seeking quality, thoughtful content over fast-paced trends. It operates primarily as a subscription-based media platform, offering both print and digital access to its curated archive of stories.",
